# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the header with the motion loop playing and a gesture (0.3.1): on
# PITCH MOVES, the longest page name, LOOP gives way while the gesture shows and comes back once it's gone.
# No expectations (main's build plays this script too).
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tapkey w0
wait 2000
tap REC
wait 200
spin K2 5
wait 300
tap REC
wait 300
key w12 down
wait 1500
page 9
wait 120
shot pitch-moves-gesture.png
key w12 up
wait 9000
shot pitch-moves-loop.png
